{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X的感受文字明显更密集，尤其S03、S09、S10、S11等短停留段，观众可能来不及消化；Y的左右分栏和精简表达更容易快速扫读。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y确实更容易扫屏，但压缩过程中丢掉了一些关键的心理转折和因果关系，例如S09从舍不得旧日生活到怀疑自己是否会因为孤单而重新忍受委屈的挣扎，X表达得更准确、更有层次。X的【】突出关键心理节点，感受文字又能把音乐变化、身体反应和人物记忆联系起来，使前后情绪形成连续的发展，而不是简单贴上悲伤、怀念、坚定等标签。作为普通观众，我会觉得X更能让我理解这个人、跟上他的内心变化，也更能感受到音乐与故事之间细腻的对应关系，尽管阅读负担明显更大。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4b425799-558f-4c4c-8f30-d57c636a7f2c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T154459849839Z", "elapsed_seconds": 35.859, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T15:45:35.735901+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1f7ae46c7a4fb7f5ee65c9bc1983df1f61281b3aefbe5da509618c2938c974b8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a